<title>singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 20.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    96/97    103/104     UNQ     189/190</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  101/103   107/109   190/193   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes hovered narrowly around their</p>
<p>recent levels on Tuesday ahead of Wednesday's domestic holiday, traders said. Shipowners were away from the Singapore market where offers have been firm in line with gains in the cargo market, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
